        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "みなさん、無事ですか！\n密猟者は……って、あ、あれ？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "2a944e9c1e920627fe5c005522053dbc37bb9722cc5e9abb344999e824e11b6d",
